  "summary_en": "Preprint proposing a Cyber-Physical-Social-Thinking ontology to classify robots and AI agents into three tiers (Confined Actors, Socially-Aware Interactors, CPST-Integrated Agents), enabling proportional governance from product liability to qualified legal personhood. It proposes assessment metrics and a composite protocol, and urges international standardization before the 2027 EU AI Act review.",
